  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Stir potatoes, whole kernel corn, cream-style corn, evaporated milk, vegetable broth, sweet onion, celery, garlic powder, dried chives, Worcestershire sauce, and black pepper together in a slow cooker. Cook 6 hours on Low, stirring occasionally.",
